	(text "Strapping and connections (from the datasheet):\n- VBUS from dock pad VIN. VBUS abs max 22 V; OVP 5.5 V typ; VBUSPOR 3.9 V. The VIN TVS (D601) is on the dock sheet, at the pad.\n- CC1/CC2 to GND: no USB-C; VBUS limit stays at the 100 mA default (enough for 40-55 mA charging).\n- VBUSOUT not used by the SoC but needs its 1 uF decoupling cap.\n- VSET1 = 68k -> BUCK1 starts at 2.0 V (datasheet table: 68k = 2.0 V, max 5% tolerance). VOUT1 = VDD_2V0.\n  2.0 V (not 1.8 V) leaves margin over the ISP2454 1.7 V minimum when the buck is 5 % low (1.9 V).\n- BUCK2 unused: VSET2 to GND (off), VOUT2 to VSYS, SW2 open, PVSS2 to GND, no inductor (as in reference config 2).\n- LOADSW1/2 unused: LSIN1, LSOUT1, LSIN2, LSOUT2 to GND (as in reference config 3). LED0-2 open.\n- VDDIO from VOUT1. Unused GPIO0/1/2/4 open: default is input with weak pull-down.\n- PMIC_INT on GPIO3 (any GPIO can be the interrupt; set in devicetree).\n- PVSS1 joins GND through net tie NT201 (one via to the GND layer), as in the reference layout.\n- NTC: 10k 1% B25/50 = 3380 K, one of the three supported types; JEITA defaults match it. Max 100 pF across it.\n- Ship mode exits on SHPHLD low (button to GND) OR VBUS > VBUSPOR, so docking alone wakes the band\n  (still confirm on the EK in Stage 0b).\n- DECIDED 2026-10-30: SHPHLD relies on the nPM1304's internal 50k pull-up. R201 (extra pull-up to VBAT) and\n  SW201 (button) stay DNP; TP203 is the way to pull SHPHLD low on the bench.\n- TWI address 0x6B. I2C pull-ups R203/R204 serve the whole 2.0 V bus (4.7k for 400 kHz).\n- JP201: cut to put the PPK2 in series with the cell; bridge again with solder."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 213.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3423439e-3867-44c0-8014-e33a487bb7ee")
	)
	(text "(check) before freezing:\n- U201 footprint: KiCad QFN-32 5x5 EP 3.45 mm; datasheet EP is 3.5 nom (3.4-3.6). Compare with Nordic's QFN reference layout.\n- U201 has no LCSC stock (only the nPM1304-EK, C50090302); source the chip elsewhere or as a consigned part.\n- L201: DFE201610E-2R2M on the KiCad DFE201610P land pattern; confirm the pad sizes.\n- GPIO3 for PMIC_INT: match the nPM1304-EK / Zephyr devicetree used in Stage 0b.\n- VSYS abs max 5.5 V: dock supply must stay at 5.0 V; DRV2605L blocked while VBUS is present."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 228.6 213.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e6d5d829-0224-4741-8799-3916af6e0951")
	)
	(text "nPM1304 power sheet (step 3). Based on Nordic nPM1304 datasheet, reference circuit 'Configuration 2' (QFN):\none buck, no LDO/load switch, ship-mode exit and NTC used. Draft until the Stage 0b nPM1304-EK tests."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 12.7 0)
		(effects
